   "priceMinor": 50000,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Mojo Green is our luckiest watch. We continue the tradition of bluesmen that like to carry a bit of magic with them… and this green is pure magic. The benefits of this watch go way beyond its lovely green watch face and bezel. It's a helpful tool for any musician, thanks to our patent-pending Circle of Fifths bezel. Just turn the bi-directional bezel to line up the key with the scale degrees and instantly transpose the song. We've even added a micro-adjusting clasp to the bracelet. This way, you can quickly flip your watch around your wrist- making it easy to read no matter what position in which you hold your instrument. Of course, this watch has even more value as a quality piece of jewelry. The 316L stainless steel case and band, as well as the sapphire crystal and 100m of water resistance, help it hold up to wear and tear. You can truly appreciate the beauty of this Swiss-made watch when you flip it over and see the movement through the transparent case back. The Mojo Green watch makes an excellent gift for the musician in your life- whether you're celebrating their first paying gig or wishing them luck as they head off to school. There's even more to the Mojo Green watch. Just keep reading below.",
