    }
   ],
   "priceMinor": 50000,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "\"There was no one near to confuse me, so I was forced to become original.\" - Joseph Haydn The Midnight Jam is our black-on-black modern classic watch. The vintage styling can be enjoyed anywhere from an orchestra show to a music festival. Because black is always the new black and classic style is forever. This Swiss-made watch goes beyond just the beauty of basic black. It features a 316L stainless steel bracelet, a sapphire crystal, 100m of water resistance, and a ceramic bezel. It's built with quality. Speaking of the bezel, that's what makes Troubadour Watches unique. Our patent-pending design features a bi-directional Circle of Fifths. This can help you whether you need to quickly transpose something or if you need to improvise. The Midnight Jam watch might have a black bezel and face, but even in the dark, you'll be able to read it thanks to the C3 Blue Line X1 grade Superluminova. As musicians, we know: it's always hard to find a gift for us. What do we need that we don't already have? How can we buy something they can really use? The Midnight Jam from Troubadour Watch makes an excellent gift for your favorite musician. Feel free to explore all the features of the Midnight Jam watch below.",
