   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "The Blue Note watch is an ode to jazz… bourbon with a cigar… and late nights filled with the laughter of friends! Whether you're a Coltrane, Monk, or Davis fan, this watch reflects their durability through the years. Not only does the Blue Note watch have a sapphire crystal, but it also has a 316L stainless steel case and bracelet. In addition, this watch holds up with 100m of water resistance, and the C3 Blue Line X1 grade Superluminova will allow you to keep time in even the darkest jazz club. What makes Troubadour Watches unique is our bi-directional ceramic bezel. The blue bezel and watch face showcase a cool blue. Our patent-pending design features the Circle of Fifths making this Swiss-made watch a valuable tool for any musician. The Blue Note Troubadour Watch makes a great gift- for any Jazz lover or musician. Take a look at all the features of The Blue Note watch below.",
